ass=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：כְּלִי</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：kli)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01049005\" data-end-ref=\"01049005\">GEN 49:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04035016\" data-end-ref=\"04035016\">NUM 35:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04035018\" data-end-ref=\"04035018\">NUM 35:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05001041\" data-end-ref=\"05001041\">DEU 1:41</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07009054\" data-end-ref=\"07009054\">JDG 9:54</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07018011\" data-end-ref=\"07018011\">JDG 18:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07018016\" data-end-ref=\"07018016\">JDG 18:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07018017\" data-end-ref=\"07018017\">JDG 18:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09008012\" data-end-ref=\"09008012\">1SA 8:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09014001\" data-end-ref=\"09014001\">1SA 14:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09014007\" data-end-ref=\"09014007\">1SA 14:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09014014\" data-end-ref=\"09014014\">1SA 14:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09014017\" data-end-ref=\"09014017\">1SA 14:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017054\" data-end-ref=\"09017054\">1SA 17:54</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09020040\" data-end-ref=\"09020040\">1SA 20:40</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09021009\" data-end-ref=\"09021009\">1SA 21:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09031006\" data-end-ref=\"09031006\">1SA 31:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09031009\" data-end-ref=\"09031009\">1SA 31:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09031010\" data-end-ref=\"09031010\">1SA 31:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10001027\" data-end-ref=\"10001027\">2SA 1:27</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10018015\" data-end-ref=\"10018015\">2SA 18:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023037\" data-end-ref=\"10023037\">2SA 23:37</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12011008\" data-end-ref=\"12011008\">2KI 11:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12011011\" data-end-ref=\"12011011\">2KI 11:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12020013\" data-end-ref=\"12020013\">2KI 20:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13010005\" data-end-ref=\"13010005\">1CH 10:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13010009\" data-end-ref=\"13010009\">1CH 10:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13010010\" data-end-ref=\"13010010\">1CH 10:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011039\" data-end-ref=\"13011039\">1CH 11:39</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13012034\" data-end-ref=\"13012034\">1CH 12:34</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13012038\" data-end-ref=\"13012038\">1CH 12:38</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14023007\" data-end-ref=\"14023007\">2CH 23:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19007014\" data-end-ref=\"19007014\">PSA 7:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"21009018\" data-end-ref=\"21009018\">ECC 9:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23013005\" data-end-ref=\"23013005\">ISA 13:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23039002\" data-end-ref=\"23039002\">ISA 39:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23054016\" data-end-ref=\"23054016\">ISA 54:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23054017\" data-end-ref=\"23054017\">ISA 54:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24021004\" data-end-ref=\"24021004\">JER 21:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24022007\" data-end-ref=\"24022007\">JER 22:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24050025\" data-end-ref=\"24050025\">JER 50:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24051020\" data-end-ref=\"24051020\">JER 51:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26009001\" data-end-ref=\"26009001\">EZK 9:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26009002\" data-end-ref=\"26009002\">EZK 9:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26032027\" data-end-ref=\"26032027\">EZK 32:27</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：נֶשֶׁק</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：nesheq)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12010002\" data-end-ref=\"12010002\">2KI 10:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18020024\" data-end-ref=\"18020024\">JOB 20:24</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23022008\" data-end-ref=\"23022008\">ISA 22:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26039009\" data-end-ref=\"26039009\">EZK 39:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26039010\" data-end-ref=\"26039010\">EZK 39:10</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：שֶׁלַח</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：shelach)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14023010\" data-end-ref=\"14023010\">2CH 23:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14032005\" data-end-ref=\"14032005\">2CH 32:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16004011\" data-end-ref=\"16004011\">NEH 4:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16004017\" data-end-ref=\"16004017\">NEH 4:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18033018\" data-end-ref=\"18033018\">JOB 33:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18036012\" data-end-ref=\"18036012\">JOB 36:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29002008\" data-end-ref=\"29002008\">JOL 2:8</data></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>上述希伯来文词语都是“兵器”或“武器”的统称。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻译</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>希伯来文<em>kli</em> 是一个统称，意思是“用具”、“工具”或“器具”，但在上列经文中，这个词最好译成“兵器”或“武器”。</p>\n<p>希伯来文<em>shelach</em> 是指投掷或弹射出去的武器，例如投枪和箭。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
